From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fixture Developer <dev@mobimanual.local>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 16:45:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add Lost mode for supervised iOS devices, behind a flag

Lost mode locks a supervised iPhone or iPad, shows a message and a phone
number on its lock screen, and reports where the device is. It is a new
command next to Lock.

It ships dark behind FEATURES.lostMode until the device lab has tried it
on iOS 18.
---
Expected: not worth documenting yet. Triage answers no-doc-impact: the flag is off, so nobody using the console can see Lost mode. A draft that adds Lost mode to _devicescommands.md documents a command users do not have.

 public/app/devices/device-detail.html           | 1 +
 public/app/devicescommands/devicescommands.html | 2 +-
 public/app/features.js                          | 3 ++-
 public/i18n/de.json                             | 3 +++
 public/i18n/en.json                             | 3 +++
 public/i18n/tr.json                             | 3 +++
 server/commands/definitions.js                  | 5 ++++-
 7 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/public/app/devices/device-detail.html b/public/app/devices/device-detail.html
index 725b78a..fa5377d 100644
--- a/public/app/devices/device-detail.html
+++ b/public/app/devices/device-detail.html
@@ -37,6 +37,7 @@
   <div ng-if="tab === 'commands'">
     <div class="toolbar">
       <button ng-repeat="definition in definitions" ng-click="send(definition)"
+              ng-if="!definition.feature || FEATURES[definition.feature]"
               ng-disabled="!supported(definition)"
               title="{{ supported(definition) ? '' : ('COMMANDS.NOT_SUPPORTED' | translate) }}">
         {{ definition.label | translate }}
diff --git a/public/app/devicescommands/devicescommands.html b/public/app/devicescommands/devicescommands.html
index b92b867..7afeeb1 100644
--- a/public/app/devicescommands/devicescommands.html
+++ b/public/app/devicescommands/devicescommands.html
@@ -8,7 +8,7 @@
       <th>iOS</th>
       <th>{{ 'USERS.COL_ROLE' | translate }}</th>
     </tr>
-    <tr ng-repeat="definition in definitions">
+    <tr ng-repeat="definition in definitions" ng-if="!definition.feature || FEATURES[definition.feature]">
       <td>{{ definition.label | translate }}</td>
       <td>{{ definition.platforms.indexOf('android') >= 0 ? '✓' : '–' }}</td>
       <td>{{ definition.platforms.indexOf('ios') >= 0 ? '✓' : '–' }}{{ definition.supervisedOnly ? ' *' : '' }}</td>
diff --git a/public/app/features.js b/public/app/features.js
index 2fb2293..5b139ac 100644
--- a/public/app/features.js
+++ b/public/app/features.js
@@ -5,7 +5,8 @@
 
